    {
      "id": "u_b25341674ea75060c4715baa_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Within text notes, it's possible to enter mathematical equations using the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button from the __TRILIUM_PH_1__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_2__ (generally found under the __TRILIUM_PH_3__Insert buttons__TRILIUM_PH_4__).",
      "sourceHash": "b25341674ea75060c4715baaa75a74db13a93e72b6e567fa3771f71fcae1471d",
      "context": "Math Equations",
      "contextHash": "9c28dd8ef9e6a3f1bd55d1e21b4350932bddb54c36117212375dbb731f8622b8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3ebb38c428572272e95c0967_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "By default, the math dialog includes a MathLive visual editor and a TeX field. Disable __TRILIUM_PH_0__MathLive visual editor__TRILIUM_PH_1__ under Options → Text Notes → Features to use only the TeX field and preview.",
      "sourceHash": "3ebb38c428572272e95c0967ffc72a47b965e29b9bcd6a0d8b254e10125524c4",
      "context": "Math Equations",
      "contextHash": "9c28dd8ef9e6a3f1bd55d1e21b4350932bddb54c36117212375dbb731f8622b8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9aa93a591d47888c44e0a05d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To make the fields bigger, drag the bottom-right corner of the dialog: the MathLive editor and the TeX field grow with it.",
      "sourceHash": "9aa93a591d47888c44e0a05dd682c1de6ba7983f72b045a57192253b8ea164a6",
      "context": "Math Equations",
      "contextHash": "9c28dd8ef9e6a3f1bd55d1e21b4350932bddb54c36117212375dbb731f8622b8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1426a2c6fe5ba6b0a8028bc1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Enabling __TRILIUM_PH_0__Display mode__TRILIUM_PH_1__ will render the equation slightly bigger (especially if using big operators such as summation, or fractions) and center it. Display mode equations will act as blocks (i.e. like paragraphs, or tables) and can be inserted for example in lists. Non-display equations can be part of the text.",
      "sourceHash": "1426a2c6fe5ba6b0a8028bc154e31467fe9036eebc75fb3218d3fd8def829280",
      "context": "Math Equations",
      "contextHash": "9c28dd8ef9e6a3f1bd55d1e21b4350932bddb54c36117212375dbb731f8622b8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_56b405fc55043d2d26adf683_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Keyboard shortcuts__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "56b405fc55043d2d26adf6830801a890c02acf98dbe747514f92a58585c97ebf",
      "context": "Math Equations > Keyboard shortcuts",
      "contextHash": "e24efa2c7279560b4786cad6e58ffb6b9af8d61c88ca2549d2c6986e2815a505",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8aca0d7d9531914fba5a7085_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If inserting equations frequently, using the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__M__TRILIUM_PH_3__ keyboard shortcut can be more comfortable. Alternatively, type __TRILIUM_PH_4__ or __TRILIUM_PH_5__ to trigger the popup directly.",
      "sourceHash": "8aca0d7d9531914fba5a7085694d4508c0839b11bbbd0d868f4e4eed0c06d431",
      "context": "Math Equations > Keyboard shortcuts",
      "contextHash": "e24efa2c7279560b4786cad6e58ffb6b9af8d61c88ca2549d2c6986e2815a505",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_52a52f9d694e0ccfbebd291c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There is currently no quick way to turn an already typed-out equation, such as surrounding it with __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or pressing __TRILIUM_PH_1__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_2__+__TRILIUM_PH_3__M__TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "52a52f9d694e0ccfbebd291c90b790b98f39d7cb6ccecdeb357d129576bf10f6",
      "context": "Math Equations > Keyboard shortcuts",
      "contextHash": "e24efa2c7279560b4786cad6e58ffb6b9af8d61c88ca2549d2c6986e2815a505",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d62bfbb3f3c0bf4269fcb169_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Supported math features__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d62bfbb3f3c0bf4269fcb1699006be6aacd574d75d41c0347d3bf1abdc7c5119",
      "context": "Math Equations > Supported math features",
      "contextHash": "1a1eace9448b4b1a8623051c5f911752ceb6c61e4eb31fa69b7a91c9ce0c08c1",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2728a3a1b7907d9e3e1d0cf4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Technically we are using the KaTeX library which allows for a subset of the TeX format. To see the full list of supported features, consult the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Supported Functions__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Support Table__TRILIUM_PH_3__ from the official documentation.",
      "sourceHash": "2728a3a1b7907d9e3e1d0cf4569324c8db1043772483c6061d5ab760c5da7aba",
      "context": "Math Equations > Supported math features",
      "contextHash": "1a1eace9448b4b1a8623051c5f911752ceb6c61e4eb31fa69b7a91c9ce0c08c1",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ce1a3406943db93d3a730785_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Markdown support__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "ce1a3406943db93d3a73078521fab459217b9a41ad21815f84cc309abd678068",
      "context": "Math Equations > Markdown support",
      "contextHash": "002ab42a693daa6d4e2b9fe6d263f3402c3e3bbc1776606b431f8b8d85bde5d8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9016ca11e0a37aca03b57a13_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Math equations will be preserved when exporting to or importing from Markdown, surrounded by __TRILIUM_PH_0__ characters for inline math expressions, and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ for display mode.",
      "sourceHash": "9016ca11e0a37aca03b57a13b992863ef7397662c1131adfe04d100e0e102a9e",
      "context": "Math Equations > Markdown support",
      "contextHash": "002ab42a693daa6d4e2b9fe6d263f3402c3e3bbc1776606b431f8b8d85bde5d8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0b6841a386b57f41388c72c7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you notice any issue with the Markdown import/export for equations, feel free to __TRILIUM_PH_0__report__TRILIUM_PH_1__ it while providing the equation that causes issues.",
      "sourceHash": "0b6841a386b57f41388c72c7bc744f955a5eec0f955704940fc73c6544402d46",
      "context": "Math Equations > Markdown support",
      "contextHash": "002ab42a693daa6d4e2b9fe6d263f3402c3e3bbc1776606b431f8b8d85bde5d8",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0bf4116cf080a314e0deda9a_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Formatting the equation__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "0bf4116cf080a314e0deda9a5ba44a7dd3962773ef7043ec6a817887d4777e76",
      "context": "Math Equations > Formatting the equation",
      "contextHash": "33cad7fa7ec062855eecba718d6e3f2945ebbf93e60ad36725796c5f1a36dc17",
